  (text "HOT-PLUG INRUSH LIMITER (power-entry-instrument.md, Hot-plug inrush): Q-INRUSH between the connector\n(UMBILICAL_POS12, D-REVSHUNT and D-TVS-PWR stay there) and everything that holds charge\n (INST_POS12: C-STRIP-BULK, L-BUCK-IN, the LED row, the analog block).\nThe verbatim netlist text at the top right predates it:\nthe strip feed and the analog feed are now INST_POS12, behind Q-INRUSH, not UMBILICAL_POS12." (at 40.64 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c3a82d85-9b0f-58eb-861a-f76867eaef8e))
