    (property "Note" "D1 (owner, 2026-10-03: '10 ohm + 22 uF + 10 uF'): RECOM's standard-application output capacitor, a 10 uF MLCC at U-BUCK-A's OUT pin (R-78E5.0-1.0 datasheet p.I-4), returned to its GND pin. It lowers the converter's ripple at its source, ahead of U-USBOR and Q-USBOR. Well inside the part's 220 uF capacitive-load limit" (at 101.60 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
