  (text "PLANE STITCHING (#8-8; owner, 2026-10-04: \"add 2-3 now\"): three 100 nF from INST_POS12 (layer 3) to PWR_GND\n(layer 2), one each at J-MCU, J-UMB and the analog end, where signals change layers between the two planes'\nreferences more than 20 mm from the nearest C-LED. Each pad meets its plane by its own via at the pad\n(power-entry-instrument.md, Plane stitching)." (at 40.64 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7b0775e8-25a1-4f5c-8f4f-40d1227ce1ec))
