  (text "IDEAL-DIODE OR (issue #39; owner, 2026-10-05: \"Let's go both\"): U-USBOR (LM74700-Q1) and Q-USBOR replace\nD-USBOR-A (SS14). BUCK_A_OUT reaches INST_5V_A through the FET, 20 mV regulated; the Matrix's USB-C 5 V\n(through its own D1) cannot back-feed the buck, nor the buck the USB host (power-entry-instrument.md)." (at 279.4 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 83a5b9af-1740-5fb7-933d-d1538a624ad3))
